; ========================================================
; ExoKey Parametric N-Way Clamping Plate Generator
; Job: Complete N-Way Clamping Plate Kit (9 pairs)
; Machine: Duet 2 CNC (RepRapFirmware)
; Stock: 2.00 mm Aluminum Sheet
; Ball Diameter: ⌀ 4.8 mm | Pocket Depth: 1.10 mm
; Clamping Screw: M2.5
