G21            ; Metric units (mm)
G90            ; Absolute positioning
G94            ; Feed rate units mm/min
G17            ; XY plane selection
G0 Z5.00 F2000 ; Retract to safe Z
M3 S18000   ; Spindle ON (18000 RPM)
G4 P1500       ; Wait 1.5s for spindle to reach full speed

